    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Bundle Services</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If you need insurance, loading, or storage, bundle them in a single quote. Carriers often offer a 3–5% discount for combined services, which saves you from negotiating separately.</p>
