    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Some firms add a “fuel surcharge” at the end of the month. Verify whether the surcharge is flat or percentage‑based and ask for a cap if you’re booking mid‑month.</p>
